# DS-0002: "Specify at least 1 USER command in Dockerfile with non-root user"
# Accepted risk, documented rationale:
# The Dockerfile here builds a CI job-container image (ghcr forge-cli) used by
# GitHub Actions `container:` jobs. The Actions runner requires root inside
# job containers — a non-root USER breaks checkout and workspace writes
# (mounted /__w is not writable by arbitrary UIDs). The image never runs in
# production; it only executes CI steps on ephemeral runners.
DS-0002
